$f(R,T^{\\\\varphi})$\\n  Gravity\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"19 pages, 9 figures, to appear in AHEP\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
