                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  This paper is devoted to find out cylindrically \
symmetric kinematic\\nself-similar perfect fluid and dust solutions. We study \
the cylindrically\\nsymmetric solutions which admit kinematic self-similar \
vectors of second,\\nzeroth and infinite kinds, not only for the tilted fluid \
case but also for the\\nparallel and orthogonal cases. It is found that the \
parallel case gives\\ncontradiction both in perfect fluid and dust cases. The \
orthogonal perfect\\nfluid case yields a vacuum solution while the orthogonal \
dust case gives\\ncontradiction. It is worth mentioning that the tilted case \
provides solution\\nboth for the perfect as well as dust cases.\\n\""}]}, {
