according to their\\n  Matter Collineations\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"15 pages, LaTex, no figures\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"J.Math.Phys.45:1518-1531,2004\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1063/1.1650537\""}]}, {
