Akihiro\n  Ishibashi", "title" -> "Black-Hole Bombs and Photon-Mass Bounds", 
             "comments" -> 
             "5 pages, 2 figures. References added. Matches published \
version", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> "10.1103/PhysRevLett.109.131102", 
