                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We use non-perturbative U-duality symmetries of type \
II strings to construct\\nnew vacuum solutions. In some ways this generalizes \
the F-theory vacuum\\nconstructions. We find the possibilities of new vacuum \
constructions are very\\nlimited. Among them we construct new theories with \
N=2 supersymmetry in\\n3-dimensions and (1, 1) supersymmetry in 2-dimensions.\
\\n\""}]}, {
