, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Recent numerical investigations have uncovered a \
surprising result:\\nReissner-Nordstrom-de Sitter black holes are unstable \
for spacetime dimensions\\nlarger than 6. Here we prove the existence of such \
instability analytically,\\nand we compute the timescale in the near-extremal \
limit. We find very good\\nagreement with the previous numerical results. Our \
results may me helpful in\\nshedding some light on the nature of the \
instability.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
