Models Coupled\\n  to Gravity\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"27 pages\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Nucl.Phys.B806:656-683,2009\""}]}, {
                
