                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-th\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We study non-supersymmetric, extremal 4 dimensional \
black holes which arise\\nupon compactification of type II superstrings on \
Calabi-Yau threefolds. We\\npropose a generalization of the OSV conjecture \
for higher derivative\\ncorrections to the non-supersymmetric black hole \
entropy, in terms of the one\\nparameter refinement of topological string \
introduced by Nekrasov. We also\\nstudy the attractor mechanism for \
non-supersymmetric black holes and show how\\nthe inverse problem of fixing \
charges in terms of the attractor value of CY\\nmoduli can be explicitly \
solved.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
