, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We view and provide further evidence for a number of \
Swampland criteria,\\nincluding the Weak Gravity Conjecture, Distance \
Conjecture and bounds on the\\nfiniteness of the quantum gravity vacua from \
the prism of the finiteness of\\nblack hole entropy. Furthermore we propose \
that at least all of these Swampland\\nstatements may be more fundamentally a \
consequence of the finiteness of quantum\\ngravity amplitudes.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
